      "content": "hey i really need some advice on how to protect my money. i'm pretty sure my local credit union is trying to force me out by doing some kind of intentional liquidation on my accounts. they keep hitting me with random fees and declining stuff for no reason lately... it feels like they're trying to drain me out so i'll just give up and leave. what can i do to defend my accounts and stop them from completing this?",
